<title>UK: Lehman Brothers sets $100 million Dec 1997 FRN.</title>
<headline>Lehman Brothers sets $100 million Dec 1997 FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Lehman Brothers.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LEHMAN BROTHERS HOLDING PLC</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  LEHMAN BROS HOLDINGS INC</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	BASE	 1M-LIBOR  MATURITY    15.DEC.97</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     12 BP     PAY DATE  L-29.NOV.96</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   ISS PRICE  100.10    FULL FEES   10 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	L LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  U.S.	TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
